<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in higher continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in higher continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex, Stalexport and Universal rose, Debica and Rolimpex fell and BIG was flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Total turnover rose to 3.6 million zlotys from 2.2 million on Tuesday.</p>
<p>NFI units rose in a 12.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
